## Reading against the acceptance criteria and the baseline
- AC-001 gate 1: 31 of 31 within 3 searches; 30 of 31 in one search; Q13 at search 3 by rephrasing (baseline: the same).
- AC-002 gate 2: top 3 for 26 of 31 = 83.9% (>= 80%); first-search p90 575 ms (<= 1 s), max 964 ms (<= 2 s), under load averages 30-40. Rank against the chosen v1 method's baseline (investigation notes, Design Validation V1: plain 2,000-character chunks + cards, compactor runs excluded: #1 19, top 3 26, MRR 0.744): #1 18, top 3 26, MRR 0.729. UD-016 indexes Memory Compactor runs (recorded as moving one question off #1), which accounts for #1 19 -> 18.
- AC-003 DDNS: Q01-Q03 at #1.
- AC-004 Chinese: Q07 #5, Q10 #1, Q19 #1, Q22 #1, Q29 #1 (5 of 5 pass gate 1).
- AC-005: unmaskedSecrets 0 over every snippet of every search.
- Meaning pointers (AR-002): 69 meaning matches; textChunk 23, cardPart 25, firstRequest 21; emptySnippet 0.
